    "checkpoints": [
      {
        "id": "step.rebase",
        "label": "01 · Rebase an unchanged branch",
        "attrs": {},
        "tags": {},
        "step": 1,
        "view": "rebase",
        "views": [
          "rebase"
        ],
        "narrative": "### Rebase with no additional branch change\n\nmaster分支上面 **K** 到 **K+1** 次MR间的commit记为 **Diff(A)**. Branch **N** 在提出MR时的commit为\n**Diff(B)**; rebase一次到新的master产生了 **Branch N+1**.\n\n**Already known**\n\n- Diff(A) → CI(K, K+1), abbreviated **A**.\n- Diff(B) → CI(K, N), abbreviated **B**.\n\n**Run again:** A ∩ B — 同时被master变化触发的job和被MR本身commit触发的job\n\n**Reuse / skip:** B − A — 此前被Diff(B)触发且不受master影响。\n",
        "focus": []
      },
      {
        "id": "step.rebase-change",
        "label": "02 · Rebase with a new branch change",
        "attrs": {},
        "tags": {},
        "step": 2,
        "view": "rebase-change",
        "views": [
          "rebase-change"
        ],
        "narrative": "### Rebase plus an additional branch change\n\nBranch N进一步修改了**Diff(C)**. 最新的MR更改的代码包括**Diff(B) ∪ Diff(C)**. \n\n**Already known:** \nA = CI(K, K+1), B = CI(K, N).\n\n**Additionally compute:** \nDiff(C) → C = CI(N, N+1).\n\n **T = CI(K+1, N+1)**. The source expands its job set as:\n\n**T = (A ∩ T) ∪ (B − A) ∪ (C − A)**\n\n**Run again:** (A ∩ T) ∪ (C − A).\n\n**Reuse:** (B − A) \n\nSkip 掉（复用）已知的 CI(K, N) − CI(K, K+1) 结果。\n",
        "focus": []
      }
    ],
